{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Hi-Speed Jecy","Jecy is a young man on a quest for revenge; he lost his parents to the hands of the organized crime syndicate called the Bismark House - a group on a hunt to acquire a product called &lsquo;lyzorium' at any cost.  With incredible abilities such as increased speed and agility, Jecy travels through space with a girl named Tiana; Fork Green, a priest of the Heartland religion who kills criminals slowly to send them to heaven; and a living ship called Paolon. However, Jecy's revenge won't come easily - a woman named Jera, her bloodthirsty little brother Cross and a number of other adversaries stand in their way!\n\n\n(Source: Anime-Planet)"],"ja":["ハイスピード・ジェシー",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-2697","ids":{"shikimori":2697,"mal":2697,"anilist":2697,"kodik":"serial-27447"},"kodikIds":["serial-27447"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-27447":"2020-07-05T06:40:41Z"},"title":"Сверхскоростной Джесси","originalTitle":"Hi-Speed Jecy","alt":"ハイスピード・ジェシー ハイスピード・ジェシー","description":"Jecy is a young man on a quest for revenge; he lost his parents to the hands of the organized crime syndicate called the Bismark House - a group on a hunt to acquire a product called &lsquo;lyzorium' at any cost. With incredible abilities such as increased speed and agility, Jecy travels through space with a girl named Tiana; Fork Green, a priest of the Heartland religion who kills criminals slowly to send them to heaven; and a living ship called Paolon. However, Jecy's revenge won't come easily - a woman named Jera, her bloodthirsty little brother Cross and a number of other adversaries stand in their way! (Source: Anime-Planet)","year":1989,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Фантастика"],"rating":6.68,"popularity":1052,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/2697/bdbba7dc5a8a0f1f6c59648227186423.jpeg","width":420,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/